Package: aegis-files
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, aegis-icons
Description: Aegis Files — the file manager of AEGIS OS
 The adopted cutefish filemanager (see desktop/apps/filemanager,
 BSD-licensed upstream), rebranded at package time per the AEGIS
 house rule (no source forks): binary ships as aegis-files, the
 desktop entry becomes "Aegis Files" with the aegis icon theme.
 Upstream source: github.com/cutefishos/filemanager.
